[[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2429493\">7005C44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429510\">7005M11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429511\">7005M12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429507\">7005E12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429506\">7005E08</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429499\">7005D14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429476\">7005A08</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolts on the bodyshell.</p><p>2. Undo the bolts on the door.</p><p>3. Remove the gasket.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2045122.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<p>1. Remove the check strap extracting it from the door frame.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2045123.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the check strap\nand the seal are not damaged.</p><p>1. Fit the check strap in its housing with the seal.</p><p>2. Tighten the bolts securing the check strap to the door.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>FRONT DOOR OPENING LIMITER</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.2</p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Tighten the bolts fixing the check strap to the bodyshell.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>FRONT DOOR OPENING LIMITER</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.5</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2045124.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<p><a href=\"#/2429476\">7005A08</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429499\">7005D14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429506\">7005E08</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429507\">7005E12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429511\">7005M12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429510\">7005M11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429493\">7005C44</a></p>"]]